    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub032_youngf_02",
      "hash": "fe033fa1b3090042",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I go shopping in Pewter City occasionally.\\c\\nI have to take the winding trail in Viridian Forest\\nwhen I go."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub032_oldm_01",
      "hash": "1978755f4e6ce301",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub032_oldm_02",
      "hash": "1978725f4e6cdde8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh ho! So you’re working on a Pokédex!\\nThen I’ll give you a piece of advice.\\c\\nYou’d do well to stock up on Poké Balls at a\\nPoké Mart before you continue your adventure!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub032_musashi_01",
      "hash": "9768d2491369333f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: What do you want? You can’t pass through\\nhere right now!\\c\\nWe’re in the middle of guard duty, and it’s\\nvery important!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub032_musashi_02",
      "hash": "9768d349136934f2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: How many times do I have to tell you?\\nYou can’t pass through here right now!\\c\\nDon’t children like you have errands to run\\nor something?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub032_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "98c6fe975db79e1d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: What’re you doing here, twerp?\\nShoo! Go pester someone else!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub032_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "98c6fb975db79904",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: I know it’s our mission to keep watch here,\\nbut it’s so boring! I wish we could go kill time in\\r\\nthe Poké Mart or something..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub032_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "0edc7c7055db0f77",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MEOWTH: Mrowr!"
    },
